<title>USA: Centennial Bancorp sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Centennial Bancorp sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>EUGENE, Ore. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centennial Bancorp on Wednesday said it set an 11-for-10 common stock split, payable on Feb. 21 to shareholders of record on Jan. 31.</p>
</text>
